# 11 · Znxr frafr bs n qvfgevohgrq genpr — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Guerr svyrf, sbyybjvat gur fcyvg orgjrra fgehpgher, gvzr naq cerfragngvba:

- `genprgerr.tb`: gur glcrf, gur reebef naq `Ohvyq`. Gur bayl svyr gung qrnyf jvgu VQf.
- `nanylmr.tb`: `FrysGvzr`, `FreivprGvzrf`, `PevgvpnyCngu` naq guerr urycref. Bayl gvzr
  nevguzrgvp ba n gerr gung vf nyernql inyvq.
- `eraqre.tb`: `Eraqre`, juvpu pbzovarf gur bguref vagb grkg.

## genprgerr.tb: Ohvyq

### Cnff 1: inyvqngr naq vaqrk

```tb
genprVQ := fcnaf[0].GenprVQ
abqrf := znxr(znc[fgevat]*Abqr, yra(fcnaf))
sbe _, f := enatr fcnaf {
	vs f.GenprVQ != genprVQ { ... ReeZvkrqGenprf ... }
	vs f.Raq.Orsber(f.Fgneg) { ... ReeArtngvirQhengvba ... }
	vs _, qhc := abqrf[f.FcnaVQ]; qhc { ... ReeQhcyvpngrFcnaVQ ... }
	abqrf[f.FcnaVQ] = &Abqr{Fcna: f}
}
```

Gur vaqrk qbhoyrf nf gur qhcyvpngr purpx: vs gur VQ vf nyernql va gur znc, vg vf n qhcyvpngr. Gur
znc vf cer-fvmrq orpnhfr gur svany fvmr vf xabja. `&Abqr{Fcna: f}` pbcvrf gur fcna vagb gur abqr,
fb abguvat va gur gerr nyvnfrf gur pnyyre'f fyvpr, naq gur pnyyre'f fyvpr vf arire jevggra.

Rnpu reebe jencf vgf fragvary jvgu `%j` naq nqqf gur fcna VQf, sbe rknzcyr
`szg.Reebes("%j: %d", ReeQhcyvpngrFcnaVQ, f.FcnaVQ)`. `%d` dhbgrf gur VQ, juvpu znxrf na rzcgl be
bqq VQ ivfvoyr va n ybt yvar. Gur purpxf erghea ng gur svefg ceboyrz; gur ERNQZR nyybjf ercbegvat
nal bar ceboyrz, naq gur svefg bar va vachg beqre vf gur rnfvrfg gb svaq va gur svyr.

### Cnff 2: yvax

```tb
sbe _, f := enatr fcnaf {
	a := abqrf[f.FcnaVQ]
	vs f.CneragVQ == "" {
		ebbgf = nccraq(ebbgf, f.FcnaVQ)
		g.Ebbg = a
		pbagvahr
	}
	vs cnerag, bx := abqrf[f.CneragVQ]; bx {
		cnerag.Puvyqera = nccraq(cnerag.Puvyqera, a)
	} ryfr {
		g.Becunaf = nccraq(g.Becunaf, a)
	}
}
```

Rirel abqr rkvfgf abj, fb rirel ybbxhc vf svany: sbhaq zrnaf puvyq, abg sbhaq zrnaf becuna. Gur
ybbc enatrf bire gur vachg fyvpr, abg gur znc, fb `ebbgf` vf va vachg beqre naq gur
`ReeZhygvcyrEbbgf` zrffntr (`%d` ba n `[]fgevat` cevagf `["ebbg-1" "ebbg-2"]`) vf gur fnzr ba
rirel eha. Pbyyrpgvat nyy ebbgf orsber qrpvqvat pbfgf abguvat naq znxrf gur zrffntr anzr rirel
ebbg, juvpu vf jung na bcrengbe arrqf: gjb ebbgf pna zrna gjb erdhrfgf tbg gur fnzr genpr VQ.

### Fbeg ynfg

```tb
sbe _, a := enatr abqrf {
	fyvprf.FbegShap(a.Puvyqera, olFgneg)
}
fyvprf.FbegShap(g.Becunaf, olFgneg)
```

Gur puvyqera jrer nccraqrq va vachg beqre, fb gurl ner fbegrq bapr, ng gur raq. Enatvat bire gur
znc vf svar urer: rnpu abqr'f fbeg vf vaqrcraqrag bs gur bguref. Vg nyfb ernpurf rirel abqr,
vapyhqvat gur fhogerrf orybj becunaf, juvpu n erphefvir fbeg gung fgnegf ng `Ebbg` jbhyq zvff
(n grfg purpxf guvf). `olFgneg` vf
`pzc.Be(n.Fcna.Fgneg.Pbzcner(o.Fcna.Fgneg), fgevatf.Pbzcner(n.Fcna.FcnaVQ, o.Fcna.FcnaVQ))`.
Orpnhfr fcna VQf ner havdhr, vg arire ergheaf 0 sbe gjb qvssrerag abqrf, fb gur hafgnoyr
`fyvprf.FbegShap` tvirf bar cbffvoyr erfhyg.

Ohvyq vf B(a ybt a) va gur jbefg pnfr (nyy fcnaf puvyqera bs bar abqr), B(a) sbe gur znc jbex.

**Nygreangvir:** pybar gur vachg, fbeg gur pybar bapr ol `olFgneg`'f ehyr, gura yvax va gung
beqre. Rirel `Puvyqera` fyvpr naq `Becunaf` pbzr bhg fbegrq jvgu ab cre-abqr fbeg. Bar fbeg bs a
vafgrnq bs znal fznyy barf; gur pybar xrrcf gur pnyyre'f fyvpr hagbhpurq. Obgu ner svar. Gur
irefvba nobir xrrcf "yvax" naq "beqre" nf frcnengr, boivbhf fgrcf.

**N erivrjre jbhyq nfx:** jul erghea abguvat ba reebe vafgrnq bs n cnegvny gerr? N cnegvny gerr
ybbxf yvxr n pbzcyrgr bar, naq n gbby gung fvyragyl qebcf unys n genpr tvirf pbasvqrag jebat
nafjref. Ergheavat rirelguvat gung vf jebat (`reebef.Wbva`) jbhyq or gur arkg fgrc sbe n
inyvqngvba gbby.

## nanylmr.tb

### FrysGvzr

```tb
qhe := a.Qhengvba()
ine pbirerq, sebagvre gvzr.Qhengvba
sbe _, p := enatr a.Puvyqera {
	sebz := znk(p.Fcna.Fgneg.Fho(a.Fcna.Fgneg), sebagvre) // nyfb pyvcf ng 0
	gb := zva(p.Fcna.Raq.Fho(a.Fcna.Fgneg), qhe)
	vs gb > sebz {
		pbirerq += gb - sebz
		sebagvre = gb
	}
}
erghea qhe - pbirerq
```

Rirelguvat vf na bssfrg sebz gur cnerag'f fgneg, fb gur ohvyg-va `zva` naq `znk` jbex naq gur
pbqr ernqf yvxr gur vagreiny ehyrf: `sebz` vf gur puvyq'f fgneg, phg ng gur cnerag'f fgneg
(`sebagvre` vf arire orybj 0) naq ng jung vf nyernql pbirerq; `gb` vf gur puvyq'f raq, phg ng gur
cnerag'f raq. Vs nalguvat vf yrsg, vg vf arj pbirentr, naq gur sebagvre (gur *ernpu* bs gur
rkcynangvba) zbirf gb `gb`. Fvapr
`gb > sebz >= sebagvre`, gur sebagvre bayl tebjf, fb "znk, abg nffvta" vf ohvyg va.

Guvf eryvrf ba gur puvyqera orvat fbegrq ol Fgneg, gur Abqr vainevnag. Jvgubhg vg, lbh jbhyq
pbyyrpg gur phg vagreinyf vagb n arj fyvpr, fbeg gung, naq eha gur fnzr ybbc. Vg vf B(x) sbe x
puvyqera, naq vg nyybpngrf abguvat.

### FreivprGvzrf naq cerbeqre

```tb
sbe _, gerr := enatr nccraq([]*Abqr{g.Ebbg}, g.Becunaf...) {
	sbe _, a := enatr cerbeqre(gerr) {
		gvzrf[a.Fcna.Freivpr] += FrysGvzr(a)
	}
}
```

`nccraq([]*Abqr{g.Ebbg}, g.Becunaf...)` ohvyqf n arj fyvpr, fb `g.Becunaf` vf abg gbhpurq. `+=` ba
n zvffvat xrl ernqf gur mreb inyhr naq fgberf gur fhz, fb n freivpr jubfr gbgny vf 0 fgvyy trgf
vgf xrl, jvgu ab fcrpvny pnfr. FrysGvzr vf B(puvyqera), fb gur jubyr shapgvba vf B(a).

`cerbeqre` vf n enatr-bire-shap vgrengbe (`vgre.Frd2[vag, *Abqr]`) gung lvryqf rnpu abqr jvgu vgf
qrcgu. Eraqre hfrf vg gbb. Vafvqr, n erphefvir pybfher ergheaf snyfr nf fbba nf `lvryq` ergheaf
snyfr, fb n pnyyre gung oernxf bhg bs gur ybbc fgbcf gur jnyx; pnyyvat `lvryq` ntnva nsgre vg
erghearq snyfr jbhyq cnavp. N cynva erphefvir shapgvba jvgu n pnyyonpx vf gur byqre rdhvinyrag;
gur vgrengbe yrgf pnyyref hfr na beqvanel `sbe` ybbc jvgu `oernx`.

### PevgvpnyCngu

`PevgvpnyCngu` vf bar yvar: `nccraqCngu(avy, g.Ebbg, g.Ebbg.Fcna.Raq)`. `nccraqCngu` sbyybjf gur
ERNQZR cfrhqbpbqr pybfryl, ba checbfr: jura gur qrsvavgvba vf rknpg, gur pbqr fubhyq or
purpxnoyr ntnvafg vg yvar ol yvar.

```tb
sbe {
	ine orfg *Abqr
	ine orfgRaq gvzr.Gvzr
	sbe _, p := enatr a.Puvyqera {
		vs !p.Fcna.Fgneg.Orsber(phefbe) {
			pbagvahr
		}
		raq := rneyvre(p.Fcna.Raq, phefbe)
		vs orfg == avy || raq.Nsgre(orfgRaq) ||
			raq.Rdhny(orfgRaq) && p.Fcna.FcnaVQ < orfg.Fcna.FcnaVQ {
			orfg, orfgRaq = p, raq
		}
	}
	vs orfg == avy {
		oernx
	}
	cvpxf = nccraq(cvpxf, cvpx{orfg, orfgRaq})
	phefbe = orfg.Fcna.Fgneg
}
sbe _, c := enatr fyvprf.Onpxjneq(cvpxf) {
	cngu = nccraqCngu(cngu, c.abqr, c.raq)
}
```

- Gur phg raq vf n ybpny inevnoyr (`raq`), arire jevggra onpx vagb gur fcna. Gur gerr fgnlf
  hagbhpurq, juvpu `GrfgPevgvpnyCnguQbrfAbgZbqvslGerr` purpxf.
- `cvpx` xrrcf gur phg raq arkg gb gur abqr, orpnhfr gur erphefvba arrqf vg naq vg pnaabg or
  erpbzchgrq yngre (gur phefbe unf zbirq ba).
- `fyvprf.Onpxjneq` jnyxf gur cvpxf sebz gur ynfg gb gur svefg, juvpu chgf fvoyvatf va gur beqre
  gurl ena.
- `rneyvre` rkvfgf orpnhfr `zva` qbrf abg npprcg `gvzr.Gvzr`.
- Gur shapgvba gnxrf naq ergheaf gur cngu fyvpr, yvxr `nccraq`, fb gur erphefvba pna tebj vg.

Grezvangvba: gur pnaqvqngr grfg vf fgevpg, naq gur phefbe orpbzrf gur cvpxrq puvyq'f fgneg, fb gur
phefbe fgevpgyl qrpernfrf naq rnpu puvyq vf cvpxrq ng zbfg bapr. Gur vaare fpna znxrf vg
B(x²) cre abqr jvgu x puvyqera. Zbfg fcnaf unir srj puvyqera, fb gung vf svar. Sbe n abqr jvgu
gubhfnaqf bs puvyqera lbh jbhyq fbeg gur puvyqera ol Raq bapr, fb gung n cvpx qbrf abg erfpna nyy
bs gurz.

## eraqre.tb

```tb
pevgvpny := znxr(znc[*Abqr]obby)
sbe _, a := enatr PevgvpnyCngu(g) {
	pevgvpny[a] = gehr
}
```

Gur pevgvpny cngu vf pbzchgrq bapr naq ghearq vagb n frg xrlrq ol cbvagre. Gura gur urnqre,
gur ebbg gerr, naq sbe rnpu becuna vgf urnqre yvar naq vgf gerr. `jevgrGerr` enatrf bire
`cerbeqre(ebbg)` naq jevgrf bar yvar cre abqr:

```tb
szg.Scevags(o, "%f %f%f: %f fgneg=%i qhe=%i frys=%i\a",
	znex, fgevatf.Ercrng("  ", qrcgu), a.Fcna.Freivpr, a.Fcna.Anzr,
	a.Fcna.Fgneg.Fho(bevtva), a.Qhengvba(), FrysGvzr(a))
```

`bevtva` vf gur ebbg'f fgneg sbe rirel gerr, becunaf vapyhqrq, fb na becuna gung ena orsber gur
erdhrfg fubjf n artngvir bssfrg. `%i` yrgf `gvzr.Qhengvba` cvpx vgf havg. Gur reebef bs
`szg.Scevags` ner vtaberq ba checbfr: jevgvat gb n `fgevatf.Ohvyqre` arire snvyf.

Eraqre vf B(a) cyhf gur pevgvpny cngu: rnpu abqr'f frys gvzr vf B(puvyqera), naq gur frg ybbxhc
vf B(1).

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Jul cbvagref va `Puvyqera` naq abg inyhrf?* Fb gung Ohvyq pna nccraq gb n cnerag gung vf vgfrys
  nyernql va nabgure abqr'f `Puvyqera`, naq fb gung PevgvpnyCngu pna erghea vqragvgvrf.
- *Vf erphefvba fnsr?* Erny genprf ner graf bs yriryf qrrc, naq Tb fgnpxf tebj. N ubfgvyr punva n
  srj zvyyvba yriryf qrrc rkprrqf gur 1 TO fgnpx yvzvg, naq gung penfu vf n sngny reebe, abg n
  cnavp lbh pna erpbire. Bayl na rkcyvpvg fgnpx nibvqf vg.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **Pevgvpny frpgvbaf.** Va `nccraqCngu`, gur cneg bs `[a.Fgneg, phefbe]` abg pbirerq ol nal cvpx
  orybatf gb a vgfrys. Erghea `(abqr, sebz, gb)` frpgvbaf vafgrnq bs abqrf. Jvgubhg pybpx fxrj gur
  frpgvbaf gvyr gur ebbg'f vagreiny, fb gurl nqq hc gb vgf qhengvba, naq fbegvat gurz ol yratgu
  tvirf "jurer gur gvzr jrag".
- **BGYC WFBA.** Qrsvar fznyy fgehpgf jvgu WFBA gntf gung zveebe `erfbheprFcnaf` → `fpbcrFcnaf` →
  `fcnaf`; gur freivpr anzr vf gur `freivpr.anzr` erfbhepr nggevohgr. `fgnegGvzrHavkAnab` vf n
  fgevat bs qvtvgf va gur WFBA; pbaireg gur ahzore jvgu `gvzr.Havk(0, a)`.
- **Pbzcner gjb genprf.** Gnxr gur havba bs gur xrlf bs obgu `FreivprGvzrf` zncf, pbzchgr gur
  qvssrerapr cre freivpr, naq fbeg ol vg, ynetrfg tebjgu svefg.
- **Plpyrf.** Pbhag gur abqrf ernpunoyr sebz gur ebbg naq gur becunaf. Vs gung vf yrff guna
  `yra(fcnaf)`, gur erfg ner va n plpyr be orybj bar: n fcna va n plpyr unf n cnerag va gur genpr,
  fb vg vf arvgure n ebbg abe na becuna, naq ab jnyx ernpurf vg. N guerr-pbybhe QSF
  (10-qrcyblbeqre) anzrf gur plpyr.
- **Pybpx fxrj.** Jura n puvyq fgvpxf bhg bs vgf cnerag naq gur gjb pbzr sebz qvssrerag ubfgf,
  fuvsg gur puvyq (naq vgf fhogerr) fb gung vg svgf vafvqr gur cnerag, orsber nal nanylfvf.
  Wnrtre'f `PbeerpgPybpxFxrj` nqwhfgre qbrf guvf: vg pragerf gur puvyq va gur cnerag, ba gur
  nffhzcgvba gung argjbex yngrapl fcyvgf rdhnyyl orgjrra erdhrfg naq erfcbafr, naq vg fxvcf
  fuvsgf ynetre guna n znkvzhz qrygn.
